{"link":{"rel":"self","url":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/item/6671c479d34e84915adb7536"},"relatedItems":{"link":{"url":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/itemLinks?itemId=6671c479d34e84915adb7536","rel":"related"}},"id":"6671c479d34e84915adb7536","identifiers":[{"type":"DOI","scheme":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/vocab/category/item/identifier","key":"doi:10.5066/P9IA3TUS"}],"title":"United States Large-Scale Solar Photovoltaic Database (ver. 4.0, April 2026)","summary":"Analysts from the US Geological Survey  and the Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory collaborated to develop and release the United States Large Scale Solar Photovoltaic Database (USPVDB).  This effort built from the expertise gained while developing the regularly updated United States Wind Turbine Database (USWTDB). Starting from the Energy Information Administration (EIA) data, locations of LSPV facilities were visually verified using high-resolution aerial imagery; a polygon was drawn around the extent of facility panel arrays, and facility attributes were appended. Quality assurance and control were achieved via team peer review and comparing the USPVDB to other datasets of U.S. solar photovoltaic. Some facility information did [...]","body":"<div>Analysts from the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.usgs.gov/programs/energy-resources-program\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(51, 122, 183) !important;\">US Geological Survey<\/a>&nbsp;&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femp.lbl.gov%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csciencebase_datarelease%40usgs.gov%7C31e72b507f0643d9fddc08dcbb0ecca0%7C0693b5ba4b184d7b9341f32f400a5494%7C0%7C0%7C638590919434583643%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=spniXLP2v%2Bb2lU%2BQq7XDbKpSGTWtkHlF%2F6Fbe%2BdjSMI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Original URL: https://emp.lbl.gov/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory<\/a>&nbsp;collaborated to develop and release the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://eerscmap.usgs.gov/uspvdb\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">United States Large Scale Solar Photovoltaic Database (USPVDB)<\/a>. &nbsp;This effort built from the expertise gained while developing the regularly updated&nbsp;<a href=\"https://eerscmap.usgs.gov/uswtdb/viewer/#3/37.25/-96.25\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(51, 122, 183) !important;\">United States Wind Turbine Database (USWTDB)<\/a>. Starting from the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eia.gov%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csciencebase_datarelease%40usgs.gov%7C31e72b507f0643d9fddc08dcbb0ecca0%7C0693b5ba4b184d7b9341f32f400a5494%7C0%7C0%7C638590919434595755%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=IUpRHyLkpaq9h5LT%2BAfmeUZ8cKxnBYFAHOx%2FguFhmdg%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(51, 122, 183) !important;\" title=\"Original URL: https://www.eia.gov/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">Energy Information Administration (EIA)<\/a>&nbsp;data, locations of LSPV facilities were visually verified using high-resolution aerial imagery; a polygon was drawn around the extent of facility panel arrays, and facility attributes were appended. Quality assurance and control were achieved via team peer review and comparing the USPVDB to other datasets of U.S. solar photovoltaic. Some facility information did not exist within our source data or not yet built, not built at all, or located elsewhere. Thus, uncertainty exists for certain facilities and are rated in a confidence level. None of the data are field verified.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>All versions (current and legacy) are&nbsp;available for download at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5066/P9IA3TUS\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">https://doi.org/10.5066/P9IA3TUS<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/div>\n","citation":"Fujita, K.S., Ancona, Z.H., Kramer, L.A., Straka, M., Gautreau, T.E., Garrity, C.P., Robson, D., Diffendorfer, J.E., and Hoen, B., 2023, United States Large-Scale Solar Photovoltaic Database (ver. 4.0, April 2026): U.S. Geological Survey data release, https://doi.org/10.5066/P9IA3TUS.","purpose":"The purpose of this information is to provide a publicly available, spatially referenced, national dataset of Large Scale Solar Photovoltaic (LSPV) and some of their technical specifications. An appropriate use of the data would be for scientific analysis, research, or for general interest for the public.","provenance":{"annotation":"Revision 4.0 by Louisa Kramer on April 16, 2025. To review the changes that were made, see “CHANGELOG_uspvdb_v4_0_20260414.txt” in the attached files section.","dateCreated":"2024-06-18T17:31:37Z","lastUpdated":"2026-06-09T19:57:12Z"},"materialRequestInstructions":"\n","maintenanceUpdateFrequency":"Yearly","hasChildren":false,"parentId":"66707f69d34e89718fa3f82f","contacts":[{"name":"Sydny Fujita","type":"Point of Contact","contactType":"person","email":"uspvdb@lbl.gov","organization":{"displayText":"Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory"},"primaryLocation":{"officePhone":"510-486-5796","streetAddress":{},"mailAddress":{"line1":"1 Cyclotron Road","city":"Berkeley","state":"CA","zip":"94720","country":"United States"}}},{"name":"Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory","type":"Point of Contact","contactType":"organization","email":"uspvdb@lbl.gov","organization":{},"primaryLocation":{"officePhone":"510-486-5796","streetAddress":{},"mailAddress":{"line1":"1 Cyclotron Road","city":"Berkeley","state":"CA","zip":"94720","country":"United States"}}},{"name":"K. Sydny Fujita"